// Gym Trainer hack: decorating the Pallet Town Gym.
//
// Decorations are bought at the gym PC and kept in the gym's storage. The player places them
// in "edit mode": they walk around freely (nothing blocks them), the selected decoration is
// shown in front of them (in red where it can't go), A places it, START turns it, SELECT puts
// away the one in front, L/R switch decorations and B finishes. With a floor selected, A paints
// the square in front (held down, every square walked to) and SELECT fills the area. The
// catalog is generated by tools/gym_hack/build_gym_decor.py; src/gym_room.c draws the room.
//
// Save data: FireRed never uses the secret base area of the save (Emerald's 20 secret bases,
// 3200 bytes), so the gym's storage and layout live there. See struct GymDecorSaveData.

